      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The park borders sand dunes, barrier islands, and sandstone cliffs that shelter endangered species like the Gulf of Saint Lawrence Aster and Piping Plover.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
